# Regulation Crowdfunding — founder and investor façade

## Number formatting — dollars, for the prose below

<!-- l4: decide:three digits of -->

**1.** In relation to a NUMBER “n”, three digits of means if n is less than 10, then concatenate 00 and n as string; otherwise, if n is less than 100, then concatenate 0 and n as string; otherwise, n as string.

<!-- l4: decide:grouped -->

**2.** In relation to a NUMBER “n”, grouped means if n is less than 1000, then n as string; otherwise, concatenate grouped with FLOOR with the result of dividing n by 1000, , and three digits of with the result of n modulo 1000.

<!-- l4: decide:dollars -->

**3.** In relation to a NUMBER “n”, dollars means if n is equal to FLOOR with n, then concatenate $ and grouped with n; otherwise, concatenate $ and n as string.

<!-- l4: decide:never below zero -->

**4.** In relation to a NUMBER “n”, never below zero means if n is at least 0, then n; otherwise, 0.

## Citizen inputs — flat records, plain-English @desc on every field

<!-- l4: declare:RaisePlan -->

**5.** In this Act, “RaisePlan” means a record consisting of—

    (a) “organized in the United States”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (b) “already files Exchange Act reports”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (c) “an investment company”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (d) “has a bad actor disqualification”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (e) “behind on past Reg CF annual reports”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (f) “has no specific business plan”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (g) “amount you want to raise”, being a NUMBER;

    (h) “raised under Reg CF in the last 12 months”, being a NUMBER; and

    (i) “has raised under Reg CF before”, being a BOOLEAN.

<!-- l4: declare:InvestorFacts -->

**6.** In this Act, “InvestorFacts” means a record consisting of—

    (a) “an accredited investor”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (b) “your annual income”, being a NUMBER;

    (c) “your net worth”, being a NUMBER; and

    (d) “invested under Reg CF in the last 12 months”, being a NUMBER.

<!-- l4: declare:ResaleFacts -->

**7.** In this Act, “ResaleFacts” means a record consisting of—

    (a) “date the securities were issued to you”, being a DATE;

    (b) “date of the transfer”, being a DATE;

    (c) “selling back to the issuer”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (d) “buyer is an accredited investor”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (e) “part of a registered offering”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (f) “to a family member or the equivalent”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (g) “to a trust you control”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (h) “to a trust for your family”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (i) “in connection with a death”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (j) “in connection with a divorce”, being a BOOLEAN; and

    (k) “in connection with the like”, being a BOOLEAN.

<!-- l4: declare:ReportingFacts -->

**8.** In this Act, “ReportingFacts” means a record consisting of—

    (a) “now files Exchange Act reports”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (b) “annual reports filed since last sale”, being a NUMBER;

    (c) “your holders of record”, being a NUMBER;

    (d) “your total assets”, being a NUMBER;

    (e) “all securities repurchased”, being a BOOLEAN; and

    (f) “liquidated or dissolved”, being a BOOLEAN.

## Answers — flat records carrying the result, the reasons and the caveats

<!-- l4: declare:RaiseAssessment -->

**9.** In this Act, “RaiseAssessment” means a record consisting of—

    (a) “you can use Reg CF”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (b) “the most you can raise now”, being a NUMBER;

    (c) “blockers”, being a list of STRING;

    (d) “financial statements you must provide”, being a FinancialStatementRequirement;

    (e) “why those financial statements”, being a STRING;

    (f) “what you must still line up”, being a list of STRING;

    (g) “after you raise you must”, being a list of STRING;

    (h) “caveats”, being a list of STRING; and

    (i) “law as in force”, being a STRING.

<!-- l4: declare:InvestmentLimitAnswer -->

**10.** In this Act, “InvestmentLimitAnswer” means a record consisting of—

    (a) “you have no limit”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (b) “your 12 month limit”, being an optional NUMBER;

    (c) “you have already used”, being a NUMBER;

    (d) “you can still invest”, being an optional NUMBER;

    (e) “we measured against”, being a NUMBER;

    (f) “which limb applies”, being a STRING;

    (g) “how this is worked out”, being a STRING; and

    (h) “caveats”, being a list of STRING.

<!-- l4: declare:ResaleAnswer -->

**11.** In this Act, “ResaleAnswer” means a record consisting of—

    (a) “you may transfer”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (b) “days you must still wait”, being a NUMBER;

    (c) “why”, being a STRING; and

    (d) “caveats”, being a list of STRING.

<!-- l4: declare:ReportingExitAnswer -->

**12.** In this Act, “ReportingExitAnswer” means a record consisting of—

    (a) “you may stop reporting”, being a BOOLEAN;

    (b) “the conditions that let you stop”, being a list of STRING;

    (c) “while the duty runs you must”, being a list of STRING; and

    (d) “caveats”, being a list of STRING.

